# A predicate asked about a FUNCTION name. The VM has the function bound and
# answers 0 via the #708 opaque band — a function has no content to sample.
#
# The AOT does not env-bind compiled functions, so a naive "env miss means
# undefined" raised `undefined variable 'g'` and exited 1 here, against the
# VM's 0 and exit 0. That divergence was INTRODUCED by the fix for #119 and
# caught by attacking it; this fixture is the witness.
#
# (Until round 62 this fixture also pinned a REBINDING half — `g is 4.0`
# after the define, "the env lookup runs first". That half witnessed only
# one direction of the kind-flip and rounds 61–62 measured three
# divergences in the scoped acceptance built on it; the whole flip class
# now refuses by name — refuse/observed_kind_flip.eigs is its pin.)
define g(x) as:
    return x + 1.0
u is 5.0
u is 6.0
print of ("fn.equi=" + (str of (equilibrium of g)))
print of ("fn.conv=" + (str of (converged of g)))
print of "done"
